\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Confidence scores and per-image processing time in the controlled closed-set visual test ($n=30$ images per object class). Bars indicate mean $\pm $ SD; half violins, points, segments, and open circles indicate distributions, individual observations, IQRs, and medians, respectively. Reference lines indicate the confidence threshold of 0.25 and the overall means for confidence (0.853) and processing time (48.19 ms). The reported processing time does not represent end-to-end task-trigger latency.}}{11}{}\protected@file@percent }
