\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces Paired task completion times for modes C and E across 27 matched task blocks. Points below the identity line indicate shorter completion time in mode C. For the paired difference $\Delta T=T_E-T_C$, positive values favor mode C. The violin, horizontal segment, and diamond show the distribution, median, and mean of the paired differences, respectively. The mean paired difference was 1.79 s (matched-block bootstrap 95\% CI, 1.10--2.51 s), and 22 of 27 blocks favored mode C.}}{13}{}\protected@file@percent }
